        "TileImage": "$($repository 5d0ab4bf-589c-432d-8cc4-ad29513ab497).Image",
        "Description": "Sept. 15, 2006.\r\rSanta Fortuna, Colombia.\r\rCiao, agente 47. Today the next stronzi are Matteo Curriello Romero, Manfredo Valladario Gigante, Vittorio Covassio Giambalvo, Armando Michelotto Rapisarda &amp; Romano Quintino Tessitore. How I know these assholes are five of those who was in on killing three of my brothers, was bc two of my soldati Torres Piombo &amp; Jack Espinoza was down in Colombia on my behalf to find info about them. Kill those stronzi, 47. And all of them is easy targets.\r\rGrazie mille",
